00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:10.162
| must be making a weird face.

00:06:10.371 --> 00:06:15.042
| don't understand those
kinds of things, so...

00:06:21.841 --> 00:06:24.802
That's it? That's good.

00:06:25.011 --> 00:06:26.095
Is it?

00:06:26.304 --> 00:06:29.557
Yeah, that's great.

00:06:29.765 --> 00:06:33.936
Really? Thank you, Mashiki-san.

00:06:35.771 --> 00:06:37.899
