00:07:04.175 --> 00:07:05.593
Study hard at cram school.

00:07:05.801 --> 00:07:06.427
See you later.

00:07:06.636 --> 00:07:07.762
Bye.

00:07:21.484 --> 00:07:23.569
Thank you.

00:07:28.658 --> 00:07:30.743
Thank you.

