see each other again,

00:18:45.709 --> 00:18:49.004
as long as we remember,
we can still look back.

00:18:49.212 --> 00:18:50.714
Mashiki?

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:58.847
So I want to have as much fun as I can.

00:18:59.056 --> 00:19:00.349
Yeah.

