00:20:17.592 --> 00:20:20.220
| started swimming after reading that.

00:20:20.429 --> 00:20:21.930
What?

00:20:27.394 --> 00:20:30.397
The prince doesn't give up
in the face of adversity

00:20:30.605 --> 00:20:32.649
and keeps on swimming.

00:20:32.858 --> 00:20:36.778
It seemed so cool to me.

00:20:36.987 --> 00:20:38.697
Water is interesting.

00:20:38.905 --> 00:20:40.115
It feels heavy at first,

00:20:40.323 --> 00:20:45.203
but if you keep trying, your body
and heart start to feel lighter.

00:20:45.412 --> 00:20:46.747
Swimming is fun.

00:20:46.955 --> 00:20:48.790
The water feels good.

00:20:48.999 --> 00:20:54.546
I'm really glad I found
that book in kindergarten.

00:20:54.755 --> 00:20:55.422
Mashiki.

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:56.840
What?

00:21:02.304 --> 00:21:05.849
You went to Wakaba Kindergarten, too, right?

00:21:06.057 --> 00:21:07.517
You did, too?

00:21:07.726 --> 00:21:09.269
Bye-bye.

00:21:14.524 --> 00:21:18.069
That wasn't originally my book.

00:21:18.278 --> 00:21:22.991
There was a girl who read
it to me and gave it to me.

00:21:30.749 --> 00:21:34.252
It's an important memory.

00:21:34.461 --> 00:21:38.590
She's really special to me, too.

00:21:39.466 --> 00:21:42.928
Mashiki, are you...

00:21:47.599 --> 00:21:49.267
Mashiki?

00:22:10.455 --> 00:22:18.964
Another city light blinks out

00:22:19.172 --> 00:22:28.807
Seems I'm the only one
being left behind like this

00:22:29.015 --> 00:22:37.524
I leaned in close to the light
of the vending machine

00:22:37.732 --> 00:22:46.658
And bought something
other than my usual coffee

00:22:46.867 --> 00:22:51.329
I wonder if I can be myself

00:22:51.538 --> 00:22:57.377
From now on, and even further beyond

00:22:58.503 --> 00:23:07.470
Surely someday we'll come
to know sadness as love

00:23:07.679 --> 00:23:16.813
Reconnecting somewhere
and parting again, over and over

00:23:17.022 --> 00:23:30.577
Surely the day will come when we're
all too used to feeling joy

00:23:30.785 --> 00:23:37.125
Call that happiness

